-- FIVE jeepney routes from the SakaySmart project (github.com/klausterphobic/SakaySmart)
-- Two terminals:
--   Batangas Grand Terminal (stop 1): Alangilan, Balagtas  (yellow Poblacion signboards)
--   SM Batangas Terminal    (stop 3): Libjo, San Isidro, Capitolio
-- Every route is a loop that starts and ends at its terminal. The jeeps pick up anywhere along
-- the way, so a route has only two stops: its terminal and one stop where it turns back.
-- The route lines follow the streets, so no road tool is needed.
-- =====================================================================

-- stop 2 = turnaround of Alangilan/Balagtas; stop 3 = the second terminal ("Terminal" in the
-- name = green pin); stops 4-6 = turnarounds of the new routes (no pin, but searchable)


